        "date": "2026-11-23T16:53:55Z"
      },
      "message": "perf(sim): index verifier island slices exactly, keep every plane\n\nRest::island_holds scanned the whole cached slice with Region::contains on\nevery point query. Add an exact Y-slab point index (slice_index) that reads\nonly the edges whose Y span holds the query and uses the same crossing\narithmetic, so the answer equals Region::contains bit for bit.\n\nKeep every cut plane and every sample: revert the rejected levels-plus-\ndeepest plane set (cut_planes) and its wire-up in reach.rs and mod.rs.\n\nPin the index directly against Region::contains, and extend the all-plane\nequivalence pin to a stepped fixture (a wide low block under a narrow tall\nblock) that loses 30 part-true ShankHits with only the deepest band.\n\nFixes #3615\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
